  "runtimeNotes": [
    "Clips target the scholar skeleton. three GLTFLoader de-duplicates node names, so the apprentice's bones and props load as <name>_1: strip /_\\d+$/ from names in the apprentice clone before binding the clips.",
    "three also sanitises '.' out of node names: hand.R loads as handR.",
    "Props carry extras.hidden = true (userData.hidden in three); hide them on load and show the one clipFor names.",
    "walk is in place: move the root at walk.speedMps x timeScale, or set timeScale = rootSpeed / walk.speedMps to keep the feet planted.",
    "sit_down (standing idle pose -> sit_idle pose) and stand_up (the reverse) play at the seat: the root stays at the cushion centre; cross-fade 0.25 s into the next clip."
